---
/**
 * Server Island - picks a random witty tagline on each request.
 * Re-renders on every page view so visitors get variety instead of a
 * fixed line, without any client-side JavaScript.
 *
 * Every entry leans on the same joke: "I'm not going to bore you with
 * my life story here." Feel free to add/remove/rewrite freely.
 */
const quotes = [
  // meta / "nothing to see here"
  "Yet another generic life story is in another castle.",
  "No long bio. Read the code.",
  "My origin story is under NDA.",
  "404: autobiography not found.",
  "The autobiography is still in pre-alpha.",
  "No mission statement. Just commits.",
  "Life story? I barely have a changelog.",
  "The 'about me' section was garbage-collected.",
  "I'd write a bio, but then you'd have to read it.",
  "Spared you the 'passionate about clean code' paragraph.",
  "My personality is in the commit history.",
  "The tragic backstory is out of scope.",
  "No bio. No mission. Just shipped things.",
  "Skipped the life story. It's in another tab.",
  "Out of office: indefinitely.",
  "Currently: yes.",
  "Tried being mysterious. Forgot why.",
  "On LinkedIn I'm 'driven.' Here I'm just tired.",

  // dev / tooling humor
  "git rm bio.md",
  "Migrated the life story to /dev/null.",
  "Lazy-loading the bio. You wouldn't await it anyway.",
  "The bio was tree-shaken out of the bundle.",
  "Bio deprecated in v2.0.",
  "Life story: still in beta. Probably always will be.",
  "Bio.toString() returned [object Object].",
  "You can't grep for character.",
  "My bio failed CI.",
  "Bio: feature-flagged off in prod.",
  "Pull request #1: 'Add personality'. Closed, won't fix.",
  "Type 'me' is not assignable to type 'interesting'.",
  "Refactored my bio. The diff is empty.",
  "Stack overflow in bio.compile().",
  "Cache-Control: no-bio.",
  "Tried to JSON.stringify my life. Circular reference.",
  "// TODO: write bio (since 2019)",
  "throw new BiographyMissingError();",
  "Bio: Promise<never>.",
  "satisfies undefined",
  "Bio.length === 0.",
  "rm -rf ~/bio",
  "The bio was undefined behavior.",
  "Bio merged to main. Reverted in 30 seconds.",

  // gaming nods
  "Press any key to skip the intro cutscene.",
  "Life story speedrun: any%.",
  "The bio is behind a diamond block.",
  "Achievement unlocked: didn't write a bio.",
  "Life story: New Game+.",
  "Hardcore mode - no autobiography.",
  "The bio was a lie.",
  "It's dangerous to go alone. Read the projects.",
  "You died. But you have a portfolio.",
  "Loading save file... no bio data.",
  "Lore tab disabled for this playthrough.",
  "Gotta ship 'em all.",
  "Charisma: 8. Bio writing: -2 modifier.",
  "Insert coin to continue. Or don't.",
  "Amnesiac protagonist, at your service.",
  "My character build is chaotic neutral.",
  "Escape to main menu - no save.",
  "The bio is a locked chest. You lack the key.",
  "Respec'd out of the 'personal branding' tree.",
  "Skill tree: respec'd into shipping.",
  "Stamina too low. Cannot write bio.",
  "Bio: locked. Unlocks at NG+7.",
  "The bio is in a chest behind a fog wall.",
  "Bio dropped. Common rarity.",
  "Praise the sun. Read the projects.",
  "The bio is a side quest. Not on the radar.",
  "Tutorial complete. No bio reward.",
  "Wake up samurai. Still no bio.",
  "Critical hit on the bio. It died.",
  "Fast travel disabled in this region.",
  "Bio summoned. Bio gone. Anor Londo.",
  "Bio: blue shell incoming.",

  // web / internet
  "Bio: 304 Not Modified, ever.",
  "Bio: blocked by uBlock Origin.",
  "<bio>404</bio>",
  "Cookies declined. So is the bio.",
  "Bio: cached by Cloudflare.",
  "Lighthouse score: bio missing.",
  "robots.txt: Disallow: /bio",
  "Bio: ad-blocked.",
  "DNS poisoned my origin story.",

  // brutal
  "Nothing here would impress you anyway.",
  "You opened a portfolio. Lower your expectations.",
  "Not writing a bio is the most interesting thing about me.",
  "Nobody reads the 'about me'. I'm nobody too.",
  "You came here for the projects. Scroll.",
  "My life peaked at my last merge commit.",
  "Personal brand: mildly bothered.",
  "Life story: untested in prod.",
  "Segfaulted the autobiography. Core dumped.",
  "Writing a bio is admitting defeat.",
  "Time we never get back.",
  "Bio.exe has stopped responding.",
  "Get a hobby. Not this one. Yours.",
  "Touch grass. Not mine.",
  "Mediocre at scale.",
  "Basically just here.",
  "I peaked in beta.",
  "Cope, then commit.",
  "All I do is ship and disappoint.",
  "Rejected from my own LinkedIn.",
  "Imposter, but with documentation.",
  "If this site disappears tomorrow, you'll forget me by Tuesday.",
  "An anonymous reviewer once called my bio 'fine.'",
  "The footnote of someone else's life.",
  "I'm not the main character.",

  // absurd / non-sequitur
  "Three projects and a vibe.",
  "Code talks. Bios mumble.",
  "I have no bio. I have receipts.",
  "Less interesting than my dependencies.",
  "The bio is in my other pants.",
  "Bio fell out of the bag at the airport.",
  "Subletting my biography.",
  "Bio: same as yours, probably.",
  "My bio is a postcard. From a place I haven't been.",
  "The bio went out for cigarettes in 2018.",
  "Bio kidnapped by ducks.",

  // existential
  "Existence > exposition.",
  "Bios are theater.",
  "We're all just humans pretending to have hobbies.",
  "The bio is a coping mechanism.",
  "I'd write more, but the heat death of the universe is approaching.",
  "The bio was never the point.",
  "Still here. Mostly.",
  "Yes, this is all of it.",
];

const quote = quotes[Math.floor(Math.random() * quotes.length)];
---

<p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">{quote}</p>
